  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>ertapenem</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>J01DH03</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Wittau M et al. 2017</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>morbidly obese patients after laparoscopic visceral surgery</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>ertapenem</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_ertapenem/Ertapenem_Wittau2017_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>total clearance</td><td>12.3</td><td>liters/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>volume of distribution at steady state</td><td>57.8</td><td>liters</td><td><small>Vss</small></td></tr><tr><td>V (V1+V2)</td><td>14.3</td><td>L</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr></table><h4>About ertapenem</h4><p>Ertapenem is a carbapenem antibiotic used to treat bacterial infections such as sepsis, urinary tract infections, pyelonephritis, and skin infections. It is an approved antibiotic, authorised in the European Union, and used for a range of community-acquired bacterial infections.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q553220\">Wikidata Q553220</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Ertapenem\">Ertapenem</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Wittau M et al. (2017). Population Pharmacokinetics and Target Attainment of Ertapenem in Plasma and Tissue Assessed via Microdialysis in Morbidly Obese Patients after Laparoscopic Visceral Surgery. <i>Antimicrobial agents and chemotherapy 61(1)</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1128/AAC.00952-16\">10.1128/AAC.00952-16</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/27795367\">27795367</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Wittau_2017: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
